OL,3,GNEWSANew apple named after road where
OL,4,Ait was discovered
OL,5,
OL,6,FKonni Deppe, founder of Luton Orchards,
OL,7,Fsaid she was "really excited" the name
OL,8,Fhad been approved, adding that
OL,9,F"everyone with a Bedfordshire apple
OL,10,Fcollection can now grow the Clarendon
OL,11,FBlush".
